---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { posts } from '../data/posts';
---

<Base
  title="Tim Wu"
  description="I build software systems with a focus on architecture, reliability, and real-world engineering."
  path="/"
>
  <p class="kicker">Software Engineer</p>
  <h1>Tim Wu</h1>
  <p class="kicker">Backend Systems · AI Systems · Robotics</p>
  <p class="lede">
    I build software systems with a focus on architecture, reliability, and real-world engineering.
  </p>

  <h2>Engineering Focus</h2>
  <h3>Backend Systems</h3>
  <p>Backend architecture, distributed systems, service communication, and reliable server-side infrastructure.</p>
  <h3>C++ &amp; Linux</h3>
  <p>Systems programming, concurrency, networking, performance analysis, and low-level engineering.</p>
  <h3>AI Systems</h3>
  <p>AI application architecture, agent orchestration, real-time voice interaction, and model integration.</p>
  <h3>Robotics Software</h3>
  <p>ROS 2, robotics middleware, device communication, and the software infrastructure behind intelligent machines.</p>

  <h2>Selected Work</h2>
  <p>A collection of engineering projects and technical explorations. Each project focuses on practical implementation, system design, and engineering decisions.</p>
  <p><a href="/projects/">Projects</a> · <a href="/2026/11/12/dungeon-with-a-main-path/">有主线的地牢</a></p>

  <h2>Latest Writing</h2>
  <ul>
    {
      posts.map((post) => (
        <li>
          <a href={post.href}>{post.title}</a>
          <div class="meta">
            {post.pubDate}
            {post.archived ? ' · Archived' : ''}
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</Base>
